datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2023 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2023-03-07","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"We believe this recognition highlights our long-standing track record of disruptive innovation, including our use of AI and indicators of attack to stop cyber adversaries in real time.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2024 Q1","e":"crwd","d":"2023-05-31","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"While we expect that LLMs will become commoditized over time, the data on which they are trained will not.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2024 Q1","e":"crwd","d":"2023-05-31","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Gregg Moskowitz","x":"And for George, so I know you've been incorporating AI into Threat Graph and the broader platform for years, but on Charlotte, you alluded to commoditizing LLM but might you leverage open-source and develop your own LLM space under a dataset to provide additional value there.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2024 Q2","e":"crwd","d":"2023-08-30","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Levine","x":"But maybe put a finer point on why you think what your moat is around Charlotte AI?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2024 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2024-03-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"CrowdStrike was able to deliver an expected 70% time reduction in management as well as more than $5 million in annual staffing cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2024 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2024-03-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"From day one, we've been an AI company, training the industry's most effective and accurate AI models to prevent attacks based upon our dat