e":"crwd","d":"2024-11-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"George Kurtz","x":"While our recently launched AI SPM offering enables organizations to secure the adoption of AI within their cloud infrastructure, Adaptive Shield works by protecting the enterprise from GenAI risk.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q3","e":"crwd","d":"2024-11-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"George Kurtz","x":"At the same time, Flex seamlessly takes cost out of cybersecurity programs, eliminating organizational and product inefficiencies from the long list of legacy, disjointed point product cybersecurity tools.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q3","e":"crwd","d":"2024-11-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"George Kurtz","x":"Working across the customer C-suite, specifically with the CFO, we aligned cybersecurity innovation with cost reduction, platform consolidation with protection outcomes and payment terms with ROI, delivering eight figures of customer business value benefits within three years of purchase.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q3","e":"crwd","d":"2024-11-26","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"George Kurtz","x":"We recently announced support of Microsoft Entra ID, formerly Azure Active Directory, making CrowdStrike capable of securing the rapidly emerging identity threat vector for all Microsoft customers from highly-regulated enterprises to born-in-the-cloud AI disruptors.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2025-03-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"Businesses and governments across the globe are looking for their AI investment to yield both improved efficiencies and novel outputs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2025-03-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"The locales of AI adoption are either in cloud workloads, data centers, or even on edge devices, all of which we are market leaders in securing with AI-native technology that stops the breach.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2025-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"Consolidation, cost reduction, and automation are now the accepted enterprise and federal priorities.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2025-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Burt Podbere","x":"We are also leveraging AI to automate key sales processes and streamline reporting and workflow.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2025 Q4","e":"crwd","d":"2025-03-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Burt Podbere","x":"…environment across multiple large and growing markets, including next-gen SIEM, where we are in the early stages of disrupting a large legacy market, and newer markets such as agentic AI for cybersecurity, where our unique data advantage positions us as the natural innovation and category leader.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"CRWD 2026 Q1","e":"crwd","d":"2025-06-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"As an AI-first company, CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc. is uniquely positioned to secure the identity, the workload, the infrastructure, the data, and underlying AI models themselves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/crowdstrike-crwd-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWD 2026 Q1","e":"crwd","d":"2025-06-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"George Kurtz","x":"What's certain is that the world increasingly needs cybersecurity and increasingly needs CrowdStrike Holdings, Inc. Crow